  "name": "Chicken and Pasta Casserole with Mixed Vegetables",
  "subtitle": "A creamy baked pasta dinner with chicken and vegetables",
  "description": "Tender chicken, fusilli, creamy soups, and mixed vegetables are combined under a crisp Parmesan breadcrumb topping.",
